      "description": "Sleeper – #1 Sports Super App\nSleeper is the #1 sports app to make team picks, play real-money games, join fantasy leagues, and follow live sports events — all in one place.\nNEW: SleeperSafe - collect fantasy league dues & pay out winners securely in-app.*\nTrack live scores, chat with friends, trade fantasy players, and win real cash across major sports.\n\nFantasy Leagues, Pick’em & Survivor Pools\n- Play Lock-in Fantasy Basketball, only on Sleeper. Draft, trade, and manage H2H leagues for NBA, NFL, EPL, LaLiga and Ligue 1.\n- Survivor & Pick’em Pools – Pick weekly game winners and compete H2H for bragging rights\n- NEW: League Dues with SleeperSafe*. Commissioners can collect dues and pay out prizes all in the Sleeper app\n\nPlayer Picks*\n- Make more/less picks on players and win up to 1000x real cash\n- Pick players on NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, WNBA, Soccer, College sports, Esports, Combat sports & more\n- New users get up to $100 deposit match for Player Picks\n- Fast payouts and secure deposits with Apple Pay, Venmo, PayPal, bank transfer, and cards\n- Available in 31 states, including CA, TX, and GA\n\nTeam Picks - offered by Sleeper Markets LLC*\n- Make picks on real teams\n- Pick YES on a game winner across NFL, NBA, MLB, WNBA, Soccer, College sports, Tennis, Golf, esports and more\n- Predict outcomes for live and upcoming events, including spreads, totals, and more\n- Follow live games, call your shot, and cash in on your beliefs\n- Regulated by the CFTC & NFA\n\nStay Connected with Live Sports\n- Live Game Chat – Talk trash, react to plays, and sweat games together\n- Player & Team Chat – Discuss trades, picks, and markets movement\n- Real-Time Alerts – News, injuries, scores, and live updates in one feed\n\nWhy Sleeper\n- One app for fantasy leagues, team picks, player picks, live games, and social chat\n- Clean, modern design built for speed\n- Perfect for casual fans and serious players\n- The All-in-One, Sports Super app — only on Sleeper\n\nDownload Sleeper today — make your picks, cash in your wins.\n\n—\n*For Picks and SleeperSafe products users must be 18+ (Player Picks: 19 in AL/NE; 21 in MA/VA). Team Picks products involve degrees of risk, such as loss of funds, and participation is subject to eligibility requirements and applicable law. Nothing herein is a solicitation, recommendation, or offer to buy or sell any financial instrument, or to engage in any transaction. See our General Terms of Use at sleeper.com/terms for additional restrictions. Use responsibly. Contact 1-800-MY-RESET for help. © Blitz Studios, Inc.",
